        <briefdescription>
<para>Calls <computeroutput>cb(arg)</computeroutput> once. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The thread that actually executed the callback gets the return value of the callback. Other threads get NULL back.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>o</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>address of once_t object. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>cb</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>address of callback function. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>arg</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>argument of <computeroutput>cb</computeroutput>. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>void* return value of <computeroutput>cb(arg)</computeroutput> if the thread actually called <computeroutput>cb</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>NULL if another thread already called <computeroutput>cb</computeroutput>. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
